  "schema:comment": "Apache-2.0 code + CC-BY-4.0 synthetic data. Agent EVALUATION environment (not a model/dataset); synthetic patient data only. Preview release, no paper/DOI yet (PhysicianBench-UI benchmark to follow). HealthRex is widely understood to be Stanford's clinical-informatics group but the repo metadata does not confirm the affiliation — re-verify governance + paper on next review. Judgement auto-scored by harvester.",
